  "critique": {
    "axis": "memorability",
    "evidence": "The oversized “One residual evidence gap.” headline, restrained cyan/red/yellow accents, forensic labels, and numbered evidence card create a coherent defense-lab identity across all viewports. However, the core composition remains a familiar dark dashboard of bordered cards, status pills, and monospace metadata; the unknown/evidence-gap concept lacks a singular visual device that would make this screen instantly recognizable in a demo.",
